{"created": "2024-04-11T19:19:05.435491+00:00", "modified": "2024-04-11T19:19:05.673164+00:00", "id": 10962520, "conceptrecid": "10962519", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.10962520", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.10962519", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10962520", "metadata": {"title": "GPR dataset: pulsed radar and SFCW data for rebar detection (experimental data)", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.10962520", "publication_date": "2024-04-11", "description": "<p>GPR data corresponding to the article \"Rebar detection: Comparison of stepped frequency continuous wave and pulsed GPR\" presented in the 7th International Conference on Smart Monitoring, Assessment and Rehabilitation of Civil Structures (SMAR 2024).&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>This work presents a comparison in rebar mapping between two GPR systems with different modulation techniques: Stepped frequency continuous wave (SFCW) and pulsed radar. The SFCW system used has a frequency range of 400-6000 MHz, while the pulsed system used a ground-coupled central frequency antenna of 2.3 GHz. Measurements were conducted on laboratory specimens, with rebar diameters ranging from 8 to 32 mm. Three different specimens were used, with one for calibration and other two to analyze both the horizontal and vertical resolutions of the frequency antennas.</span></p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Solla, Mercedes", "affiliation": "Universidade de Vigo", "orcid": "0000-0003-1042-4985"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "gpl-3.0-or-later"}, "grants": [{"code": "LEO22-2-1943", "internal_id": "01jzs3b90::LEO22-2-1943", "funder": {"name": "Fundaci\u00f3n BBVA"}, "title": "2022 Leonardo Grant for Researchers and Cultural Creators"}, {"code": "PID2022-138526OB-I00", "internal_id": "003x0zc53::PID2022-138526OB-I00", "funder": {"name": "Agencia Estatal de Investigaci\u00f3n"}, "title": "OVERSIGHT project "}, {"code": "RYC2019\u2013026604\u2013I", "internal_id": "003x0zc53::RYC2019\u2013026604\u2013I", "funder": {"name": "Agencia Estatal de Investigaci\u00f3n"}, "title": "Ram\u00f3n y Cajal Contract "}], "communities": [{"id": "pid2022-138526ob-i00"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "10962519"}}]}}, "title": "GPR dataset: pulsed radar and SFCW data for rebar detection (experimental data)", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10962520", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/10962520", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/10962520?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10962520", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10962520", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.10962520", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10962520/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10962519", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/10962519", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10962519", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.10962519", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:10962520/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:10962520/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10962520/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10962520/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10962520/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/10962520/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10962520/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10962520/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10962520/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10962520/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10962520/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10962520/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10962520/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10962520/communities